{"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Article","modules":[{"name":"MapLibre"}],"role":"article","title":"Vector Tile Sources"},"kind":"article","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Add and style a vector tile source"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/maplibre-native-for-ios\/ddscirclelayerexample"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre"]]},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"occ","url":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/DDSCircleLayerExample"},"seeAlsoSections":[{"title":"Styling and Dynamic Data","generated":true,"anchor":"Styling-and-Dynamic-Data","identifiers":["doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/AnimatedLineExample","doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/WebAPIDataExample","doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/LineStyleLayerExample","doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/POIAlongRouteExample","doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/GeoJSON","doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/PMTiles","doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/FeatureStateExample","doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/FeatureStateVectorExample"]}],"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"This example uses UIKit","type":"text"}]}],"name":"Note","type":"aside","style":"note"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"This example shows how a vector data source can be added and a style for it can be configured dynamically.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The tiles are ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/maplibre\/demotiles\/tree\/gh-pages\/tiles-omt","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" that use the OpenMapTiles schema. We are interested in the ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"https:\/\/openmaptiles.org\/schema\/#poi","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" that are in the ","type":"text"},{"code":"poi","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" layer, and filter this further with an ","type":"text"},{"code":"NSPredicate","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" to only show POIs with a ","type":"text"},{"code":"class","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" of shop. Each POI has a ","type":"text"},{"code":"rank","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" which is normally used to reduce label density. In this example, we use it to demonstrate how a numeric attribute can be used for styling with the ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"https:\/\/maplibre.org\/maplibre-style-spec\/expressions\/#step","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" expression. POIs with a rank between 0 and 10 get a red color, between 10 and 20 green, etc.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["class DDSCircleLayerExample: UIViewController, MLNMapViewDelegate {","    var mapView: MLNMapView!","","    override func viewDidLoad() {","        super.viewDidLoad()","","        mapView = MLNMapView(frame: view.bounds, styleURL: AMERICANA_STYLE)","        mapView.autoresizingMask = [.flexibleWidth, .flexibleHeight]","        mapView.tintColor = .darkGray","","        \/\/ Set the map’s center coordinate and zoom level.","        let innsbruck = CLLocationCoordinate2D(latitude: 47.26497, longitude: 11.4088)","        mapView.setCenter(innsbruck, animated: false)","        mapView.zoomLevel = 14","","        mapView.delegate = self","        view.addSubview(mapView)","    }","","    \/\/ Wait until the style is loaded before modifying the map style.","    func mapView(_: MLNMapView, didFinishLoading style: MLNStyle) {","        let source = MLNVectorTileSource(identifier: \"demotiles\", configurationURL: URL(string: \"https:\/\/demotiles.maplibre.org\/tiles-omt\/tiles.json\")!)","","        style.addSource(source)","","        let layer = MLNCircleStyleLayer(identifier: \"poi-shop-style\", source: source)","","        layer.sourceLayerIdentifier = \"poi\"","        layer.predicate = NSPredicate(format: \"class == %@\", \"shop\")","","        \/\/ Style the circle layer color based on the rank","        layer.circleColor = NSExpression(mglJSONObject: [\"step\", [\"get\", \"rank\"], 0, \"red\", 10, \"green\", 20, \"blue\", 30, \"purple\", 40, \"yellow\"] as [Any])","        layer.circleRadius = NSExpression(forConstantValue: 3)","","        style.addLayer(layer)","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"DDSCircleLayerExample.png"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Map data from OpenStreetMap. Style uses OpenMapTiles."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"references":{"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS/FeatureStateExample":{"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre-native-for-ios\/featurestateexample","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/FeatureStateExample","kind":"article","title":"Set Feature State","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"This example demonstrates how to use feature state to create interactive maps with dynamic styling based on user interactions."}],"role":"article"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS/POIAlongRouteExample":{"kind":"article","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/POIAlongRouteExample","abstract":[{"text":"Use an ","type":"text"},{"code":"NSPredicate","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" to show POI and road labels along a route.","type":"text"}],"title":"POI Along a Route","role":"article","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre-native-for-ios\/poialongrouteexample","type":"topic"},"DDSCircleLayerExample.png":{"variants":[{"traits":["2x","light"],"url":"\/images\/org.swift.MyProject\/DDSCircleLayerExample@2x.png"}],"type":"image","identifier":"DDSCircleLayerExample.png","alt":null},"https://maplibre.org/maplibre-style-spec/expressions/#step":{"url":"https:\/\/maplibre.org\/maplibre-style-spec\/expressions\/#step","type":"link","titleInlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"step"}],"identifier":"https:\/\/maplibre.org\/maplibre-style-spec\/expressions\/#step","title":"step"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS/LineStyleLayerExample":{"kind":"article","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/LineStyleLayerExample","abstract":[{"text":"Adding an ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNLineStyleLayer","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" to the map using a GeoJSON file.","type":"text"}],"title":"Using GeoJSON with a line style layer","role":"article","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre-native-for-ios\/linestylelayerexample","type":"topic"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNVectorTileSource":{"fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MLNVectorTileSource"}],"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnvectortilesource","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNVectorTileSource","isActive":true},{"text":" is a map content source that supplies tiled vector data","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"in ","type":"text"},{"text":"Mapbox Vector Tile","type":"text"},{"text":" format","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"to be shown on the map. The location of and metadata about the tiles are","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"defined either by an option dictionary or by an external file that conforms to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"TileJSON specification","type":"text"},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"A vector tile source is added to an ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNStyle","isActive":true},{"text":" object along with one or more","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNVectorStyleLayer","isActive":true},{"text":" objects. A vector style layer defines the appearance of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"any content supplied by the vector tile source.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNVectorTileSource","title":"MLNVectorTileSource","role":"symbol"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS/FeatureStateVectorExample":{"kind":"article","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/FeatureStateVectorExample","abstract":[{"text":"This example demonstrates feature state on a ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNVectorTileSource","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":", toggling the appearance of countries in a vector tileset as they are tapped.","type":"text"}],"title":"Set Feature State (Vector Source)","role":"article","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre-native-for-ios\/featurestatevectorexample","type":"topic"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS/GeoJSON":{"kind":"article","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/GeoJSON","abstract":[],"title":"Working with GeoJSON Data","role":"article","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre-native-for-ios\/geojson","type":"topic"},"https://openmaptiles.org/schema/#poi":{"url":"https:\/\/openmaptiles.org\/schema\/#poi","type":"link","titleInlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"POIs"}],"identifier":"https:\/\/openmaptiles.org\/schema\/#poi","title":"POIs"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre":{"kind":"symbol","identifier